hrinks them, and the game's own spawner refills the ring as stars are colle=
cted.</li>
<li><strong>Shield</strong> works by switching obstacle colliders off while=
 it's active and testing the overlap itself.</li>
<li>The coin prices in the config are my guesses, based on one coin per poi=
